  "solution": {
    "text": "Given, stream of electron from heated filament was passed between two charge plates at potential difference <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math>.<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>and</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math> are charge and mass of electron, respectively.<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>Energy</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mfrac></math><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></mrow></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math><br /><math><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955